; --forecast-while bounds the generated forecast postings of a balance
; report, never its real postings: the real 2030/03/01 posting fails the
; predicate yet still counts.  Accounts reports install no forecast-while
; filter_posts; forecast_posts::flush withholds a failing forecast group
; from the account totals by dropping POST_EXT_VISITED (#1605).

2030/03/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

~ Monthly from 2030/06/01
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal --forecast 'date>=[2030/04/01] & date<[2030/08/01]' --now 2030/06/15
           $-1010.00  Assets:Cash
            $1010.00  Expenses
              $10.00    Food
            $1000.00    Rent
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal --flat --forecast 'date>=[2030/04/01] & date<[2030/08/01]' --now 2030/06/15 Rent
            $1000.00  Expenses:Rent
end test
